==== hyperbricks yaml {!{images}} ====
images:
  - type: images
  - directory: hyperbricks-yaml-test-files/assets/
  - id: '#img_'
  - loading: lazy
  - title: sometitle
  - width: "100"
==== explainer ====
The title attribute of the image
==== expected json ====
{
  "Alt": "",
